SCHEDULE: {"1":"Ann","2":"Ivo","3":"Elif","4":"Hana","5":"Cara","6":"Dev","7":"Ben","8":"Finn","9":"Gus"}
CONFIDENCE: 97

The chain Ivo < Hana < Dev < Ben < Finn, with Elif right after Ivo and exactly one person between Ann and Elif, forces Ann to slot 1 and Elif to slot 3. Dev must then be two slots after Hana, and Gus must be after Dev, which leaves Gus in slot 9 and Ben and Finn in 7 and 8. Cara fills the last open slot (5), and checking every constraint against this order passes.
